{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1499.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"88b5544d2b3a2ee1322176cd9f6d980b503b0686c4d26505502835c936418505","ja":"海外ブックフェアって聞いてたけど、\n本当に洋書でいっぱいね……。","zh":"虽然听说是海外书展，\n但真的全都是外文书呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1499.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1a79e3e39e0ca4a34c9642879ad57c8b8fd57825bc3ffad60791f99c8df2615f","ja":"ここだけ見てたら、\n外国の本屋さんに来ちゃった感じがするね。","zh":"只看这里的话，\n感觉就像是来到了外国的书店呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1499.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"49fb6fb097f89f8276324394aff0159749b0bd1d3951a69713bd5afa220a4dc1","ja":"あ、でも、あっちの棚には\n日本語っぽい本も置いてあったよ！","zh":"啊，不过，那边的书架上\n也放着像是日文的书哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1499.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"face7f04b841146bfeea5faedd7102aea361e2680c31b6923f1077b25a2ecce4","ja":"旅行用の会話集……。\nクロエは、こういう本で勉強してたのかも。","zh":"旅行用的日常会话集……\n克洛伊也许就是用这类书学习的吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1499.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"6d23007d6f77e3d91846c0f8db8b20c38fc36c911ab11d8f854507dc88f61bce","ja":"そうかも！　志保も、\nそういう本をオススメするの？","zh":"也许是呢！志保也会\n推荐那种书吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1499.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"31193e3d6b56886d15fcfb3d3d79f37e736074497421f968b8db4a6734f3b278","ja":"私は、絵本を何冊か。\nこのシリーズのとか、こっちのとか。","zh":"我挑了几本绘本。\n比如这个系列的，还有这边的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1499.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"469a098b36dd254380be0944e76c32e493879e2c9b1e98dba36035348bfdb291","ja":"あっ！　その絵、私も知ってる！\nすっごくかわいくて、見てるだけでも楽しいよね♪","zh":"啊！那幅画我也知道！\n超级可爱，光是看着就觉得好开心呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1499.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"0f28f04981d9b963713f5aa86f44f3149550bfc5e5fe5aea36d19f9a88a9732e","ja":"ええ。後は、子どもから大人まで\n楽しめるものも選ぼうと思って。未来は？","zh":"嗯。另外，我也想选一些\n老少咸宜的内容。未来呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1499.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"7fd376a0b77eee8d466154e9bb82f6b1b08af56be18e1264de726b9cc2b63529","ja":"私はね～……この児童文学の本！　ウサギの絵、\nどっかで見たことあるし、カワイイなーって♪","zh":"我选这个～……这本儿童文学书！上面的兔子插画，\n总觉得在哪里见过，而且好可爱呀♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1499.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"35b8717bbd4821f299f0bd0d3ba996b2d5c827c81c59c2c4c376c34f659ecc55","ja":"英語の本だけど、「子ども向けで\n簡単に読める」って、ポップにも書いてたし……。","zh":"虽然是本英语书，但推荐牌上也写着\n“适合儿童阅读，内容很简单”……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1499.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9a5f92a6bbd5e31acfaec01e5f7b94b692fb0f3b5875ce769cd15c101bf782fb","ja":"……って、あ、あれっ？\n全然わからない…………。","zh":"……等等，咦、奇怪？\n完全搞不懂…………。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1499.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"76eb97853fb746c64294a846f8bd800e5ef2fd208611fb343721c34402b8dd24","ja":"その本なら、日本語で読んだことがあるわ。\n必要なら、簡単に内容を説明する？","zh":"那本书的话，我读过日语版的。\n如果有需要，我简单给你讲讲内容？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1499.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"78adc980383baaec9deeb02d76c450e81c1a34978bb993f996cc40939d568851","ja":"本当に！？　ありがと～！\nよろしくね、志保！","zh":"真的吗！？谢谢啦～！\n多多指教哦，志保！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
